  "note": "Numbers build by multiplication and addition: 十二 is 10+2, 二十 is 2×10. Four and seven are usually yon and nana; nine is kyū. Watch sound changes: 三百 sanbyaku, 六百 roppyaku, 八百 happyaku, 三千 sanzen, 八千 hassen. Large numbers group by 万 (10,000). Age uses 〜歳 (sai), and 二十歳 is hatachi.",
